    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34264" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπεδ-όω</span></b> , impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμπέδουν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.8.2
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεπέδωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					60.28
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπεδος</span>):—<i>confirm, ratify</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺ δ᾽ ἐμπέδου δόσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					50
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					790
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				211
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polem.Hist.
				83
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπονδάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.4.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ . . ὁρκωμόσιά τε καὶ ὑποσχέσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					241b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρκους καὶ δεξιάς τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					5.1.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνθήκας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					29.24.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμολογίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.79
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδείξεσι δόγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					5.315
				</span></i>
			; <i>uphold</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπονδήν, ἀσφάλειαν
				ἐμπεδώσασθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.439
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
